  "title": "Red Hat Security Advisory: webkit2gtk3 security update",
  "description": "Multiple security vulnerabilities have been identified in the ANGLE component used by the chromium-browser within the WebKitGTK port for the GTK platform. These include use-after-free, out-of-bounds read and write, buffer overflow, type confusion, uninitialized resource, and memory corruption issues. The vulnerabilities are addressed in a security update for webkit2gtk3 provided by Red Hat for Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8.6 variants.",
